[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待たせてしまい申し訳ありません！\n現れた魔物は聖戦士たちの手で無事に討伐されました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm terribly sorry for keeping you waiting! The Sacred Knights have successfully eliminated all the monsters."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほっ、これで一安心だな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew, that's a relief."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観光客の老人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Elderly Tourist"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おかえり、アルビー。こっちは何ごともなかったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome back, Alvie. Everything was fine here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカ！\u3000見ててくれたのね、ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka! Thank you for watching over them!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お姉さん！\u3000すごいね、聖戦士の人たち！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Sacred Knights were amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観光客の子供",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Child Tourist"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、言っただろう？\u3000任せておけば大丈夫だって。\nなんたってこの国の英雄たちだからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "See? Told you they'd handle it just fine. They are Nova's heroes, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "明日の定期船も予定通り出航予定です。\n今夜は宿でゆっくりお休みください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tomorrow's regular ship will depart as scheduled. Please rest well at your inns tonight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいっ！？\u3000あ、神官長……と、\nお父さん、お母さん！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eep!? Oh, High Priest... and father, mother!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "案内人としての仕事を放棄して、\n聖戦士たちに加勢しに行ったと聞きました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hear you abandoned your duties as a Guide to assist the Sacred Knights."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "己の天命に背く行いだということは、\n理解していますね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You understand that this goes against your divine calling?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい……ごめんなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... I'm sorry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "持ち場を離れる時に、観光客に指示を出した、\nそれで配慮したことには、なりません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Giving instructions to the tourists before leaving your post does not excuse your actions."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "観光客に常に寄り添い、不安を取り除くのが、\n本来のあなたの天命",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your true calling is to remain by the tourists' side and ease their concerns."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次はないと思いなさい。\n星の神は、あなたの行いを天から見ていますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let this be the last time. The Star God watches your actions from above."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かりました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I understand."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたには数日の間、謹慎を命じます。\n少し頭を冷やしなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You are to reflect on your actions for several days. Use this time to clear your head."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ……どうしてこんなことを",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina... why would you do such a thing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシ……ベップのことが心配で。それで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... I was worried about Bepp. That's why..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは、教えに背いていい理由にはならないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's no excuse for going against our teachings."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "母親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前は頭がいい子だ、分かるだろう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're a smart girl. You understand, don't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前も、ベップも、観光客も、全員無事なのは\n本当に良かったが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While I'm relieved that you, Bepp, and the tourists are all safe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "父親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Father"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二度とこんなことはしないで。\nあなたの幸せのために",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please don't ever do this again. It's for your own happiness."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "母親",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mother"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]